  {
    "index": 3,
    "hash": "bbGxxaAqnfYvL6lSXi9p0l3gg/k=",
    "timestampUtcMs": "2026-09-03T07:43:18.654Z",
    "action": {
      "type": "SET_CONTENT",
      "input": {
        "content": "The `drive-analytics` package ships two processors \u2014 `DriveAnalyticsProcessor` for document-drive operations and `DocumentAnalyticsProcessor` for individual document operations \u2014 both converting operations into time-series points with dimensions.\n\nThe primary metric is deliberately trivial: **`DriveOperations`, a counter whose value is 1 for each operation**, at per-operation timestamp precision. All the analytical power sits in four dimension paths:\n\n| Dimension | Path format | Example |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Drive | `ph/drive/{driveId}/{branch}/{scope}/{revision}` | `ph/drive/abc123/main/global/42` |\n| Operation | `ph/drive/operation/{operationType}/{operationIndex}` | `ph/drive/operation/ADD_FILE/5` |\n| Target | `ph/drive/target/{targetType}/{targetId}` \u2014 `DRIVE` or `NODE` | `ph/drive/target/NODE/file123` |\n| Action type | `ph/drive/actionType/{actionType}/{targetId}` | `ph/drive/actionType/CREATED/file123` |\n\nThe **action-type dimension is the interpretive one**, folding raw operations into five verbs: `CREATED` (`ADD_FILE`, `ADD_FOLDER`), `DUPLICATED` (`COPY_NODE`), `UPDATED` (`UPDATE_FILE`, `UPDATE_NODE`), `MOVED` (`MOVE_NODE`), `REMOVED` (`DELETE_NODE`). That is what lets a dashboard ask \"how much creation happened\" without enumerating operation names.\n\nTwo operational behaviours: operations are processed in **configurable chunks (default 50)**, and the processor **clears and rebuilds analytics data when processing from index 0** \u2014 so a replay from the start is idempotent rather than doubling every count. Analytics data is organised under the source path `ph/drive/{documentId}/{branch}/{scope}`.\n\n## Provenance\n- `packages/common/drive-analytics/README.md` \u2014 Overview; Metrics Collected; Dimensions; Supported Operations; Data Source Structure; Key Components\n\n_Extracted from the Powerhouse repository at **v6.2.2-dev.74**._",
        "updatedAt": "2026-09-03T07:43:18.654Z"
      },
      "timestampUtcMs": "2026-09-03T07:43:18.654Z"
    }
  },
